        "Title": "Warden of Secrets",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108936747068",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 45341c93-bdb1-49e3-bad8-a5b2c49003db).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Your destination is the Himmapan Hotel in Bangkok, Thailand. Your targets are &quot;The Class&quot; manager Dexy Barat and producer Wes Liston. Our client, Thomas Cross has found out that Wes Liston has been stealing several millions of dollars from the band &quot;The Class&quot; and is planning to flee to South America. As for Dexy Barat, she apparently knows something, which could be very incriminating. Mr. Cross also asked us to retrieve a flash drive. I will leave you to prepare, good luck 47.",
